{"id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","title":"Continuous Map","display":"df-continuous-map — Continuous Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-continuous-map","aliases":["58-df-continuous-map","Continuous Map"],"display":"df-continuous-map — Continuous Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-bijective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-continuous-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-continuous-map</span><span>Continuous Map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuous-map — Continuous Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Y^X\">\\(f\\in Y^X\\)</span> (map between topological spaces)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in X\">\\(x \\in X\\)</span> (point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (continuous predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (homeomorphism predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousAt}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousAt}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (continuous at point predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (bijective predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X \\land \\forall V\\in\\tau_Y\\;(f^{-1}[V]\\in\\tau_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X \\land \\forall V\\in\\tau_Y\\;(f^{-1}[V]\\in\\tau_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}at} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousAt}_S(f,x,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land x\\in X\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\bigl(f(x)\\in V\\to\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;(x\\in U\\land f[U]\\subseteq V)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}at} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousAt}_S(f,x,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land x\\in X\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\bigl(f(x)\\in V\\to\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;(x\\in U\\land f[U]\\subseteq V)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f^{-1},Y,\\tau_Y,X,\\tau_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f^{-1},Y,\\tau_Y,X,\\tau_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuous: preimage of open sets is open</li>\n<li>Metric spaces: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall \\varepsilon &gt; 0,\\; \\exists \\delta &gt; 0,\\; d_X(x,y) &lt; \\delta \\Rightarrow d_Y(f(x),f(y)) &lt; \\varepsilon\">\\(\\forall \\varepsilon &gt; 0,\\; \\exists \\delta &gt; 0,\\; d_X(x,y) &lt; \\delta \\Rightarrow d_Y(f(x),f(y)) &lt; \\varepsilon\\)</span></li>\n<li>Intermediate value: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> continuous on interval <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> hits all values between endpoints</li>\n<li>Extreme value: continuous on compact <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> attains max/min</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Willard, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}$ (bijective predicate, see [[58-df-bijective]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousAt}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X \\land \\forall V\\in\\tau_Y\\;(f^{-1}[V]\\in\\tau_X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}at} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousAt}_S(f,x,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land x\\in X\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau_Y\\;\\bigl(f(x)\\in V\\to\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;(x\\in U\\land f[U]\\subseteq V)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f^{-1},Y,\\tau_Y,X,\\tau_X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall \\varepsilon > 0,\\; \\exists \\delta > 0,\\; d_X(x,y) < \\delta \\Rightarrow d_Y(f(x),f(y)) < \\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow","display":false}],"bytes":2060,"backlinks":[{"id":"80c210450e512314","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S$ (five-place continuity relation; see [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]])"},{"id":"a4dd694ba50eaccd","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S$ (continuous-map predicate; see [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]])"},{"id":"77a834d62558f993","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"11e1272c45fe01cc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b4d7921597565c97","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Continuous}$ 取 [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"2ff75bf9c7039be0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3f045a36dba6b5ef","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Continuous}$ 取 [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"213ce75a48289483","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Continuous}$ 取 [[../batc